      "inMain": false,
      "k": "h",
      "level": 1,
      "links": 0,
      "t": "4 Back up a database"
    },
    {
      "inMain": false,
      "k": "p",
      "links": 0,
      "t": "Tallyfold Server stores each ledger as one database file. A backup copies the file while the server runs, so users can keep working. Make a backup before each upgrade and at least once a day."
    },
    {
      "inMain": false,
      "k": "h",
      "level": 2,
      "links": 0,
      "t": "4.1 Full backup"
    },
    {
      "inMain": false,
      "k": "p",
      "links": 0,
      "t": "Run the backup command as the user that owns the server. The command writes a compressed copy to the folder that you name."
    },
    {
      "inMain": false,
      "k": "p",
      "links": 0,
      "t": "tallyfold backup --ledger main --to /srv/backups --keep 14"
    },
    {
      "inMain": false,
      "k": "p",
      "links": 0,
      "t": "The option --keep removes old copies of the same ledger and keeps the newest 14. Without --keep, the command keeps every copy, and the disk can fill up."
    },
    {
      "inMain": false,
      "k": "p",
      "links": 0,
      "t": "A backup of a ledger of 2 GB takes about 40 seconds on a normal server. During the backup, writes are slower, but no write is lost."
    },
    {
      "inMain": false,
      "k": "h",
      "level": 2,
      "links": 0,
      "t": "4.2 Restore"
    },
    {
      "inMain": false,
      "k": "p",
      "links": 0,
      "t": "To restore, stop the server first. A restore replaces the ledger file, and the server must not write to it at the same time."
    },
    {
      "inMain": false,
      "k": "p",
      "links": 0,
      "t": "tallyfold stop tallyfold restore --ledger main --from /srv/backups/main-2024-05-02.tfz tallyfold start"
    },
    {
      "inMain": false,
      "k": "p",
      "links": 0,
      "t": "After a restore, all entries made after the time of the backup are gone. Tell your users before you restore."
    },
    {
      "inMain": false,
      "k": "p",
      "links": 0,
      "t": "Page last changed: 2 May. Applies to version 4.2 and later."
    },
